<sect1 id="chapter3_1autotoc_md97_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter3_1autotoc_md97">
<title>CLI interplay</title><para><computeroutput>sattyre-cli</computeroutput> should detect <computeroutput>.smt2</computeroutput> inputs and route to the SMT parse path. If solver support is not implemented, surface <computeroutput>Unknown</computeroutput> or an explicit message. Never silently treat SMT as SAT DIMACS input.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">sattyre-cli<sp/>examples/example.smt2</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Expect<sp/>parse<sp/>success<sp/>and<sp/>a<sp/>clear<sp/>SMT<sp/>status<sp/>path</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
